    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Food",
     "texto": [
      "**A carne**, **o peixe**, **o frango** (chicken), **o arroz**, **as batatas** (potatoes), **a sopa**, **a salada**, **a fruta**, **os legumes** (vegetables), **os ovos** (eggs). The national dish is **o bacalhau**.",
      "An important trap: **a sobremesa** is «dessert». And **o bolo** is «cake»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
